USAGE: devicectl manage pair --device <uuid|ecid|serial_number|udid|name|dns_name> [--columns <columns> ...] [--hide-default-columns] [--hide-headers] [--verbose] [--quiet] [--timeout <seconds>] [--json-output <path>] [--log-output <path>]

DEVICE OPTIONS:
